  // The runtime call answers 0 with ret 0 (the call succeeded; the answer is no) in both directions -- the same
  // ANSWER `nvidia-smi topo -p2p r` printed as CNS, and that is all the two rows have in common. The nvidia-smi
  // token says the chipset does not support peer access; cudaDeviceCanAccessPeer says nothing about why, so
  // these rows carry the refusal unattributed (see PeerToPeerRefusedUnattributed). Two instruments agreeing on
